{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_006_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fcbdd55f454c8ae09e4be78b81d9abc62da371f3f1cf491c3023fc8f62c7f456",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0990254158e0772b108b49ddaf491a882e1e869f2ef37f59961eec79e4a84877",
      "text": "因为弟弟妹妹在可能会有点吵，\n如果不嫌打扰的话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9209d4db3a72b52286988d7a0c9f6da2bffcdc66034d9d204a52ddc2082e50fe",
      "text": "可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:030c8487c950cdda4fc68a2b290fe74f371eb5a3b97de3f2d2096a8ba97ec50f",
      "text": "当然可以。啊，不过，\n要劳烦您特意跑一趟就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fb0862a49faf23d92ed5ba8f59ceb5f0e94fd3401eb7e3953efd45efccaff28",
      "text": "哪里哪里，千万别这么说。那我稍后\n就过去拜访，请多关照了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000029:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16216436c5b82da4dd0de41754414e2d7a9993afd63ae3cac590ed427f10856e",
      "text": "一小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea43f96b5b1adc34f9e5436b89342eafcfe7819943bae5532734c284ffd0a0cc",
      "text": "欢迎，●●●●プロデューサー。\n请进，快请进。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc433a2879712a3a270f100ef42e9adab6bffc6ee3fdeb0d02534fda8b3b44e7",
      "text": "打扰了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dea140dc024668e5eb1b9516a0cf0000418862d43902413417520d7a882f2238",
      "text": "给您介绍一下。这边是妹妹，这边是弟弟。\n来，打个招呼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edfb0c3ca049f35dea58d7681840b2c922023fe73984c73819160e92fda21fc7",
      "text": "初次见面！\n一直承蒙您照顾哥哥了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f6432aca4d86ce4faf0af878c3fbe9c9603be3b3f260fdaa497e41abe0f5d5a",
      "text": "初、初次见面……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eabcdf1e0c5164dd45ebbfacc4f072b98004433ada949f42d234e316cb127a4a",
      "text": "初次见面。真是一对可爱的姐弟呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ab341cba5b0ea4b77db46b83fb52bc1d79c8134d1725a921b0b601a9b06d30e",
      "text": "对吧？他们可是我的骄傲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:321c5f9e790bf80e4e02255c7c4ab69b830dd9f9b3c99043901acbaf4251c8d7",
      "text": "年纪还小，把他们两个人留在家里\n总觉得不放心……不好意思，帮大忙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c96499606be0679bd5cbaf9e36dd4644b9090e6fa92fc9dc5c490d915b434942",
      "text": "那么，请坐这张桌子吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
